WEBVTT

00:00:09.428 --> 00:00:12.097
[man snoring]

00:00:12.139 --> 00:00:13.723
[barking]

00:00:17.978 --> 00:00:19.896
[grunts]

00:00:26.945 --> 00:00:28.654
[groans, meows]

00:00:31.908 --> 00:00:33.619
[gasps] [grunts]

00:00:35.287 --> 00:00:37.705
Come on, I don't have all day.

00:00:40.083 --> 00:00:42.419
[screams]

00:00:43.753 --> 00:00:45.922
[grunting]

00:00:45.964 --> 00:00:48.634
[screaming]

00:00:50.885 --> 00:00:52.720
[laughing]

00:00:52.762 --> 00:00:55.307
[screaming]

00:00:55.349 --> 00:00:57.184
Whee!

00:00:57.225 --> 00:00:58.684
[whooping]

00:00:59.727 --> 00:01:01.729
[screams approaching]

00:01:03.898 --> 00:01:05.609
[laughs]

00:01:05.651 --> 00:01:07.361
Come on, slowpokes.

00:01:07.402 --> 00:01:08.820
-Ugh. What is that smell? -Ugh.

00:01:08.862 --> 00:01:09.946
[retches]

00:01:09.988 --> 00:01:12.032
with a dash of caca. POPS: It's poo-poo

00:01:13.116 --> 00:01:14.284
[sniffing]

00:01:14.326 --> 00:01:15.494
Scent is getting stronger.

00:01:15.536 --> 00:01:17.663
[laughs] Oh!

00:01:19.164 --> 00:01:20.748
[man shouts]

00:01:20.790 --> 00:01:23.251
Oh, man.

00:01:23.293 --> 00:01:25.546
♪ ♪

00:01:28.507 --> 00:01:30.758
Duke, let's eat!

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:32.678
Oh, yes!

00:01:40.810 --> 00:01:42.020
[sniffs]

00:01:42.062 --> 00:01:44.356
Oh, it smells so good!

00:01:44.398 --> 00:01:46.900
Oh, yes!

00:01:46.941 --> 00:01:49.444
[laughs]

00:01:57.077 --> 00:01:58.245
Sausages! BOTH:

00:01:58.286 --> 00:02:00.746
[grunting]

00:02:02.082 --> 00:02:04.084
[moaning]

00:02:16.762 --> 00:02:20.559
[both exclaiming]

00:02:20.601 --> 00:02:22.768
Come on, boys!

00:02:22.810 --> 00:02:24.812
[sausages cheering]

00:02:27.357 --> 00:02:29.817
Holy schnitzel!

00:02:29.859 --> 00:02:32.446
[both laughing]

00:02:32.487 --> 00:02:33.947
♪ We go together ♪

00:02:33.988 --> 00:02:36.700
ka dinga da dinga dong ♪ ♪ Like rama lama lama

00:02:36.742 --> 00:02:38.410
