00:02:38.452 --> 00:02:40.995
♪ As shoo-bop sha wadda wadda yippity boom de boom ♪

00:02:41.037 --> 00:02:43.624
♪ Chang chang changitty chang sha-bop ♪

00:02:43.665 --> 00:02:47.210
♪ That's the way it should be ♪

00:02:47.252 --> 00:02:49.837
♪ Wha-ooh, yeah! ♪

00:02:49.879 --> 00:02:51.839
♪ We're for each other ♪

00:02:51.881 --> 00:02:54.384
♪ Like a wop ba-ba lu-bop and wop bam boom ♪

00:02:54.426 --> 00:02:56.010
♪ Just like my brother is ♪

00:02:56.052 --> 00:02:58.764
♪ Sha-na-na-na-na-na-na-na yippity dip de doom ♪

00:02:58.804 --> 00:03:00.557
♪ Chang chang changitty chang sha-bop ♪

00:03:00.599 --> 00:03:02.392
[screams] ♪ We'll always be ♪

00:03:02.434 --> 00:03:04.686
♪ Together ♪

00:03:04.728 --> 00:03:06.854
♪ Wha-ooh, yeah! ♪

00:03:06.896 --> 00:03:08.231
♪ Chang chang changitty ♪ ♪ We'll always ♪

00:03:08.273 --> 00:03:09.899
♪ Chang sha-bop ♪ ♪ Be together ♪

00:03:09.941 --> 00:03:11.192
♪ Chang chang changitty chang sha-bop ♪

00:03:11.234 --> 00:03:12.860
♪ We'll always be together ♪ [laughing]

00:03:12.902 --> 00:03:14.321
♪ Chang chang changitty chang sha-bop ♪

00:03:14.362 --> 00:03:15.739
♪ We'll always be together ♪

00:03:15.781 --> 00:03:18.617
♪ Chang chang changitty chang sha-bop... ♪

00:03:22.912 --> 00:03:25.582
Getting a weird vibe, man. BUDDY:

00:03:25.624 --> 00:03:27.584
[quiet sobbing]

00:03:27.626 --> 00:03:30.378
these guys are a bit testy. All right, now,

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:32.714
So just let me do the talking.

00:03:32.756 --> 00:03:34.591
[sobbing continues] Hey, you crybaby!

00:03:34.633 --> 00:03:36.009
Where's the viper at?!

00:03:36.050 --> 00:03:38.011
[sniffling]

00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:41.222
[sobbing loudly]

00:03:43.433 --> 00:03:45.268
Don't you worry, Viper!

00:03:45.310 --> 00:03:47.854
You will not be forgotten!

00:03:48.938 --> 00:03:51.941
You will be avenged, Viper!

00:03:51.983 --> 00:03:52.900
[sniffles]

00:03:52.942 --> 00:03:54.486
And if you don't believe me,

00:03:54.528 --> 00:03:55.903
at my battle plans. you can look

00:03:55.945 --> 00:03:58.865
It's all laid out right here.

00:03:59.741 --> 00:04:01.326
Uh, boss, TATTOO:

00:04:01.368 --> 00:04:03.203
I can't tell who anyone is.

00:04:03.244 --> 00:04:05.913
Well, you got to really look at it to understand it.

00:04:05.955 --> 00:04:07.541
Like, that's you guys right here,

00:04:07.582 --> 00:04:08.958
and, see, that's Brooklyn.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:11.503
That's where we gonna get them dogs.

00:04:11.545 --> 00:04:13.380
Bam! Bam!

00:04:13.421 --> 00:04:15.882
[cackling]

00:04:15.923 --> 00:04:17.925
That ball of fluff's got a screw loose.

00:04:17.967 --> 00:04:19.260
Let's skedaddle.

00:04:19.302 --> 00:04:21.095
SNOWBALL: But you get it, you see what I'm saying.

00:04:21.137 --> 00:04:23.931
Bottom line is, I'm coming right for you, Tiny Dog!

00:04:23.973 --> 00:04:25.892
And that big, fat, brown dog?

00:04:25.933 --> 00:04:27.101
He gonna get it, too. [gasps]

00:04:27.143 --> 00:04:28.520
Tiny Dog?

00:04:28.562 --> 00:04:30.271
There are lots of tiny dogs in the city.

00:04:30.313 --> 00:04:31.939
you're a tiny dog, okay? I mean,

00:04:31.981 --> 00:04:33.024
So let's just go.

00:04:33.066 --> 00:04:35.652
"big, fat, brown dog." He also said,

00:04:35.694 --> 00:04:37.529
Like Max's new roommate.

00:04:37.571 --> 00:04:38.946
Not necessarily. SNOWBALL: Ooh!

00:04:38.988 --> 00:04:43.951
Max, Max, Max, Max, Max, you are gonna get it!

00:04:43.993 --> 00:04:44.952
[sighs]

00:04:44.994 --> 00:04:46.413
That's kind of hard to dispute.

00:04:46.454 --> 00:04:48.415
Hey! You stay away from...!

00:04:48.456 --> 00:04:49.457
[muffled grunt]

00:04:49.499 --> 00:04:50.625
Wait, what?

00:04:50.667 --> 00:04:51.710
You know Tiny Dog?

00:04:51.752 --> 00:04:53.336
[muffled grunt] [yowls]

00:04:53.378 --> 00:04:54.671
He's my friend!

00:04:54.713 --> 00:04:56.840
And some might say my boyfriend!

00:04:56.882 --> 00:04:58.592
Uh, nobody says that.

00:04:58.633 --> 00:05:00.009
you know Tiny Dog! I can't believe

00:05:00.051 --> 00:05:01.969
It's such a small world. I mean, that's cool.

00:05:02.011 --> 00:05:04.264
[chuckles] That's the funny thing about it.

00:05:04.305 --> 00:05:05.306
Get 'em!

00:05:05.348 --> 00:05:06.725
Scatter!

00:05:06.767 --> 00:05:08.017
[animals clamoring]

00:05:08.059 --> 00:05:09.477
[Tattoo laughs, grunts]

00:05:09.519 --> 00:05:10.478
Whoa!

00:05:10.520 --> 00:05:12.522
Oh, no!

00:05:12.564 --> 00:05:13.523
Not good!

00:05:13.565 --> 00:05:15.442
[barking] Aah!

00:05:15.483 --> 00:05:17.861
[screaming]

00:05:17.903 --> 00:05:19.362
See you guys later!

00:05:19.404 --> 00:05:21.030
Oh, hang on!

00:05:21.072 --> 00:05:22.616
[screams]

00:05:24.033 --> 00:05:26.035
Everybody, run! [Buddy grunts]

00:05:31.165 --> 00:05:32.626
Derick, you idiot!

00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:34.001
Did they all get away?

00:05:34.043 --> 00:05:35.712
Uh...

00:05:35.754 --> 00:05:39.549
Phew, that was a close one!

00:05:39.591 --> 00:05:41.259
Aw, nuts.

00:05:41.301 --> 00:05:43.010
Yes! We got one!

00:05:43.052 --> 00:05:43.929
[chuckles]

00:05:43.970 --> 00:05:45.597
Oh, good for you guys! NORMAN:

00:05:45.639 --> 00:05:47.181
-Yay! -Yeah!

00:05:47.223 --> 00:05:51.018
we got your friend! Oh, yes, Tiny Dog,

00:05:51.060 --> 00:05:52.813
Advantage, me!

00:05:52.854 --> 00:05:54.606
[laughs maniacally]

00:05:54.648 --> 00:05:55.941
Uh-oh.

00:05:55.982 --> 00:05:57.358
Just ignore what just happened.

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:58.359
Okay?

00:05:58.401 --> 00:06:00.445
[laughs maniacally]

00:06:00.487 --> 00:06:01.905
Yes!

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.327
You know what?

00:06:07.368 --> 00:06:10.288
I mean, this may be the sausage talking,

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:11.790
but you're okay.

00:06:11.832 --> 00:06:13.875
Right back at ya, man.

00:06:13.917 --> 00:06:16.043
You know, when I met you, I was all like,

00:06:16.085 --> 00:06:18.713
"I don't know if I like him."

00:06:18.755 --> 00:06:22.133
But now that I know you, I'm like, "I like him."

00:06:22.175 --> 00:06:24.302
[laughs]

00:06:24.344 --> 00:06:29.056
from the outside many times. You know, I saw this place

00:06:29.098 --> 00:06:33.060
awaited within these walls, Had I known what treasures

00:06:33.102 --> 00:06:37.064
I would've broke down that door a long time ago, I'll tell ya!

00:06:37.106 --> 00:06:39.108
Uh, what are you talking about?

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:41.736
used to live around here. My old owner and I

00:06:41.778 --> 00:06:43.070
Duke, man, wait.

00:06:43.112 --> 00:06:45.031
D-Did you used to have an owner?

00:06:45.072 --> 00:06:47.909
it was a long time ago. Well, it was a...

00:06:47.951 --> 00:06:49.577
I don't want to talk about it.

00:06:49.619 --> 00:06:51.412
Yes, you do. Come on.

00:06:51.454 --> 00:06:54.165
I don't know. [sighs]

00:06:54.207 --> 00:06:55.625
But you know what?

00:06:55.667 --> 00:06:58.712
He was so cool.

00:06:58.753 --> 00:07:00.087
Yeah?

00:07:00.129 --> 00:07:03.758
Yeah. He was the best.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:06.427
[puppies barking]

00:07:08.638 --> 00:07:10.891
[door opens, bell jingles]

00:07:16.521 --> 00:07:18.356
Man, we had fun. DUKE:

00:07:21.192 --> 00:07:23.236
We'd play fetch. [barking]

00:07:26.614 --> 00:07:28.449
[man laughs]

00:07:28.491 --> 00:07:30.368
We'd go for walks.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:32.245
[man laughs]

00:07:32.286 --> 00:07:35.122
We'd take naps.

00:07:35.164 --> 00:07:37.250
We were both big nappers.

